Description:It is your first main phase. You control Tangle Mantis (3/4 trample). The opponent is at 3 life and controls Yoked Ox (0/4) and a tapped Zilortha, Strength Incarnate. Win this turn.
Rule:rulesguru-79ee460bdc4b6a91 | Under Zilortha, lethal damage to its controller's creatures is their power (CR 120.6, 702.19b): a 0-power blocker needs no damage, so a trampler assigns all of it to the player
